{"t": 1794113045.1128285, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout/promo.py` (`checkout.promo.normalize_code`).\n\n**Change:** promo codes are now normalised before lookup \u2014 surrounding whitespace stripped, inner spaces removed, and the code upper-cased (all whitespace, including tabs/newlines/non-breaking spaces from mobile keyboards, is removed via `\"\".join(code.split()).upper()`).\n\n**Verified:** `\" autumn24 \"`, `\"Autumn 24\"`, `\"  a u t u m n 2 4  \"`, `\"\\tautumn24\\n\"` and `\"SPRING\\u00a02026\"` all normalise to `AUTUMN24` / `SPRING2026`.\n\nFixes the production error in Sentry `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, ~2,940 events on Android 15 / app 8.2).", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
